5,0,1,talk,Rin,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm going to be the best detective ever and find the wolf right away! Is everyone ready?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Toshio,,"Let's keep a level head. Since we have no information, the best strategy is to observe how everyone speaks and reacts.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree with Toshio. We should look for inconsistencies. I'll be paying close attention to who tries to lead the group too aggressively.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Asuka,,Logic is the only way to win. I suggest we avoid emotional guesses and wait for the Seer's information to emerge.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,A sensible start. I'll be watching from the sidelines to see whose mask slips first. This should be interesting.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, you sound like a movie character! Hehe! Do you think the wolf is someone who acts all cool and calm?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"That's a possibility, Rin, but acting calm isn't evidence. We must be careful not to mistake personality for guilt.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Exactly. However, I am curious if anyone has a specific plan for how we should handle the Seer's reveal tomorrow.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"The Seer should only reveal themselves if the information is critical. Otherwise, they are just a target for the wolf.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,Asuka is correct. A premature reveal is a tactical error. I'm interested to see if the wolf tries to fake a Seer claim.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,"Ooh, a fake Seer! That would be a super big twist! I'll be watching for anyone who tells a lie!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Toshio,,We should also consider the Possessed. They will try to blend in and protect the wolf without being obvious.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,Which means we should be wary of people who agree too perfectly with the majority. Mirroring is a common deception.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Asuka,,I'll be analyzing the voting patterns tomorrow. The way people shift their suspicion often reveals their true alignment.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,I'm quite confident in my ability to spot those patterns. Let's see if any of you can keep up with me.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,I'm not scared! I'll find the wolf with my super-detective powers! Goodnight everyone!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Toshio,,I shall retire for now. I look forward to seeing the results of the first night.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I'll be reviewing today's dialogue. Sleep well, everyone.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Asuka,,I agree. Let us hope the night is productive for the village.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Shion,,A peaceful night to you all. I'll be waiting to see who emerges as the first suspect.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
