36,1,1,talk,Rin,,Good morning! I have a super secret! I'm the Seer and I found the wolf! It's Asuka!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"That was a very sudden reveal, Rin. While bold, it puts you in immediate danger. Are you certain of your result?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"A direct claim on day one is unusual. @Rin, why did you choose to reveal yourself and your target so quickly?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Asuka,,This is absurd. I am a villager. Rin is clearly the werewolf attempting to frame me and gain trust by claiming the Seer role.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Shion,,"A classic clash. One claims the Seer role, the other denies being the wolf. This is the perfect moment to analyze the reactions.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'm not lying! I really saw it! Asuka is the bad guy! Why would I lie about being the Seer?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, if you are not the wolf, do you have any reason to suspect Rin is faking her role?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, your enthusiasm is charming, but the werewolf often uses a ""childlike"" or ""honest"" persona to deflect suspicion.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"Exactly. Rin's claim is too convenient. By outing me immediately, she hopes to eliminate a logical threat to her position.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, you seem very quick to cast doubt on Rin. Are you protecting Asuka, or just playing the skeptic?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Rin"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Mizuki, why are you being mean? I'm telling the truth! @Shion, please believe me! Asuka is the wolf!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Shion"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"If Rin is the Seer, we should execute Asuka now. If Rin is the wolf, we are executing an innocent. It's a high-risk gamble.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I am not being mean, Rin; I am being logical. However, if Asuka is the wolf, she would naturally deny it.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I cannot prove my innocence other than by my consistency. Rin's claim is a desperate move to secure a win.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Shion,,"I find Rin's confidence intriguing, but Asuka's composure is equally polished. I'm leaning toward the Seer's vision for now.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Rin,,"See! Shion believes me! Let's vote for Asuka! Please, please, please!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
52,1,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
53,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will trust the Seer's claim for today. It is the most direct piece of evidence we have.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
54,1,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
55,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I still have doubts, but against the majority, it is safer to follow the claim. I'll vote Asuka.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
56,1,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
57,1,4,talk,Asuka,,This is a mistake that the village will regret tonight. I am innocent.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
58,1,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
59,1,4,talk,Shion,,Let's put this to a test. I'll cast my vote for the suspected wolf.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
